00:16:43,836 --> 00:16:46,255
<font color="white">Uang kita. Ayolah.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Kau sudah bicarakan dengannya?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

283
00:16:46,338 --> 00:16:48,215
<font color="white">Kenapa kau mendesakku tentang ini?</font><font color="white"></font>

284
00:16:48,298 --> 00:16:50,384
<font color="white">Karena kau yang ketua.</font><font color="white"></font>

285
00:16:50,467 --> 00:16:51,468
<font color="white">Hei, Hyun-woo.</font><font color="white"></font>

286
00:16:52,344 --> 00:16:54,054
<font color="white">Wah, selamat.</font><font color="white"></font>

287
00:16:54,138 --> 00:16:57,307
<font color="white">- Ini hebat, Teman. Sungguh.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Hei.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

288
00:16:57,391 --> 00:16:59,476
<font color="white">- Itu sangat keren.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Makasih.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

289
00:17:00,394 --> 00:17:01,812
<font color="white">Siapa kau?</font><font color="white"></font>

290
00:17:01,895 --> 00:17:04,314
<font color="white">Aku bersama anak-anak itu.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Kami adalah Megaton.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

291
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:07,526
<font color="white">Namaku Na Tae-poong.</font><font color="white"></font>

292
00:17:08,819 --> 00:17:10,404
<font color="white">Dia anggota Megaton?</font><font color="white"></font>

293
00:17:11,822 --> 00:17:13,615
<font color="white">Kami sudah sepakat untuk tetap kasual.</font><font color="white"></font>

294
00:17:13,699 --> 00:17:14,658
<font color="white">Permisi.</font><font color="white"></font>

295
00:17:14,742 --> 00:17:17,327
<font color="white">Ada yang BAB di luar toilet pria.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Bisakah kau membersihkannya?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

296
00:17:17,411 --> 00:17:19,496
<font color="white">Itu bukan perbuatanku.</font><font color="white"></font>

297
00:17:19,580 --> 00:17:22,541
<font color="white">Sang-gu, dia bukan pelayan.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Dia anggota Megaton…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

298
00:17:25,252 --> 00:17:26,086
<font color="white">Jang-poong!</font><font color="white"></font>

299
00:17:27,671 --> 00:17:28,839
<font color="white">Maafkan kesalahanku.</font><font color="white"></font>

300
00:17:28,922 --> 00:17:29,757
<font color="white">Namaku Tae-poong.</font><font color="white"></font>

301
00:17:33,093 --> 00:17:33,969
<font color="white">Na Tae-poong.</font><font color="white"></font>

302
00:17:34,553 --> 00:17:38,682
<font color="white">Kenapa bukan Jang-poong saja?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Itu nama yang lebih bagus.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

303
00:17:40,100 --> 00:17:41,101
<font color="white">Itu ide bagus.</font><font color="white"></font>

304
00:17:41,685 --> 00:17:42,519
<font color="white">Benar, bukan?</font><font color="white"></font>

305
00:17:47,524 --> 00:17:49,443
<font color="white">Selamat, ya. Penampilanmu hebat.</font><font color="white"></font>

306
00:17:49,526 --> 00:17:51,945
<font color="white">Sungguh, kau tampak sangat keren.</font><font color="white"></font>

307
00:17:55,532 --> 00:17:57,534
<font color="white">Halo. Tuan Park.</font><font color="white"></font>

308
00:17:57,618 --> 00:17:58,535
<font color="white">Aku anggota Megaton Na…</font><font color="white"></font>

309
00:18:00,746 --> 00:18:02,790
<font color="white">Anak-Anak, kenapa duduk-duduk saja?</font><font color="white"></font>

310
00:18:02,873 --> 00:18:04,208
<font color="white">Berpesta dan bergembiralah.</font><font color="white"></font>

311
00:18:04,291 --> 00:18:06,168
<font color="white">Anu, Tuan Park…</font><font color="white"></font>

312
00:18:07,252 --> 00:18:09,546
<font color="white">Tentang pembicaraan kita tempo hari.</font><font color="white"></font>

313
00:18:10,172 --> 00:18:11,256
<font color="white">Upah?</font><font color="white"></font>

314
00:18:11,882 --> 00:18:15,469
<font color="white">Kami belum menerima upah</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dari album pertama kami tahun lalu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

315
00:18:15,552 --> 00:18:18,722
<font color="white">Kalian tahu situasinya.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Hal seperti ini makan waktu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

316
00:18:19,431 --> 00:18:22,768
<font color="white">Kalian tahu, begitulah cara kerjanya.</font><font color="white"></font>

317
00:18:24,186 --> 00:18:26,438
<font color="white">Upah kalian baru saja ditangguhkan.</font><font color="white"></font>

318
00:18:26,522 --> 00:18:30,192
<font color="white">Dari sudut pandang pembukuan,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">uang kalian sedang diputarkan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

319
00:18:30,275 --> 00:18:32,152
<font color="white">Ada yang menelepon. Aku akan kembali.</font><font color="white"></font>

320
00:18:33,987 --> 00:18:34,988
<font color="white">Sial.</font><font color="white"></font>

321
00:18:36,365 --> 00:18:39,660
<font color="white">Kau lihat itu, bukan?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Sudah kutanyakan sebagai ketua.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

322
00:18:40,285 --> 00:18:41,912
<font color="white">Jika aku tak diupah,</font><font color="white"></font>

323
00:18:41,995 --> 00:18:45,124
<font color="white">kau yang pertama kuhajar, mengerti?</font><font color="white"></font>

324
00:19:08,230 --> 00:19:10,607
<font color="white">Hei, kenapa kalian tak menjawab ponsel?</font><font color="white"></font>

325
00:19:11,108 --> 00:19:12,442
<font color="white">Kita mendapat masalah besar.</font><font color="white"></font>

326
00:19:13,694 --> 00:19:14,570
<font color="white">Apa ini?</font><font color="white"></font>

327
00:19:16,405 --> 00:19:17,698
<font color="white">Diberitakan di mana-mana.</font><font color="white"></font>

328
00:19:19,324 --> 00:19:21,076
<font color="white">Apa? "Bejat" dan "hedonistik"?</font><font color="white"></font>

329
00:19:21,827 --> 00:19:24,163
<font color="white">Kita cuma minum beberapa gelas</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan bergembira.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

330
00:19:26,248 --> 00:19:27,499
<font color="white">Ya ampun, jijik!</font><font color="white"></font>

331
00:19:28,250 --> 00:19:29,960
<font color="white">Apa… Astaga.</font><font color="white"></font>

332
00:19:30,043 --> 00:19:32,254
<font color="white">Apa itu? Apakah dia sudah gila?</font><font color="white"></font>

333
00:19:33,547 --> 00:19:35,757
<font color="white">Tunggu, si idiot ini…</font><font color="white"></font>

334
00:19:35,841 --> 00:19:37,676
<font color="white">Kenapa dia bertelanjang di pesta kita?</font><font color="white"></font>

335
00:19:37,759 --> 00:19:40,304
<font color="white">- Benarkah kau memakai narkoba?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Apa kau bertindak tak senonoh?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

336
00:19:40,387 --> 00:19:42,264
<font color="white">- Bukan aku!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Kau membantah tuduhan ini?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

337
00:19:42,347 --> 00:19:44,308
<font color="white">Jika kau memakai narkoba, bersama siapa?</font><font color="white"></font>

338
00:19:44,391 --> 00:19:46,935
<font color="white">- Apa ini kali pertamamu?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Kau dituduh…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

339
00:19:47,561 --> 00:19:52,232
<font color="white"><i>Tadi, Choi Seong-gon terlihat</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>memasuki kantor polisi untuk diinterogasi.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

340
00:19:52,316 --> 00:19:55,152
<font color="white"><i>- Malam tadi, Tuan Choi…</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Apa kalian berdua memakai narkoba?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

341
00:19:58,197 --> 00:19:59,448
<font color="white">Kau memakai sesuatu, bukan?</font><font color="white"></font>

342
00:19:59,531 --> 00:20:01,533
<font color="white">Pasti. Bisa kulihat!</font><font color="white"></font>

343
00:20:01,617 --> 00:20:04,244
<font color="white">Hei, dia memakai sesuatu.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Bedebah ini juga.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

344
00:20:04,328 --> 00:20:06,580
<font color="white">Ayolah. Obat herbal pun aku tak mau.</font><font color="white"></font>

345
00:20:07,164 --> 00:20:10,459
<font color="white">Sudah kuduga si idiot itu pembawa masalah,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">bahkan belahan rambutnya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

346
00:20:13,128 --> 00:20:14,755
<font color="white">Hei, kau sudah membereskannya?</font><font color="white"></font>

347
00:20:17,174 --> 00:20:20,844
<font color="white"><i>Grup campuran populer, Triangle,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>terseret dalam tuduhan plagiarisme.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

348
00:20:20,928 --> 00:20:21,762
<font color="white">Apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

349
00:20:21,845 --> 00:20:25,224
<font color="white"><i>Lagu utama album kedua mereka</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>yang gubahan Hwang Hyun-woo</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

350
00:20:25,307 --> 00:20:28,769
<font color="white"><i>telah dituduh menyontek</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>sebuah lagu populer dari Bulgaria.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

351
00:20:28,852 --> 00:20:30,145
<font color="white"><i>Mari kita dengarkan.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

352
00:20:30,812 --> 00:20:33,232
<font color="white"><i>Sorakkan</i></font><font color="white"></font>

353
00:20:33,315 --> 00:20:35,609
<font color="white"><i>Sorakkan</i></font><font color="white"></font>

354
00:20:35,692 --> 00:20:36,818
<font color="white"><i>Sorakkan</i></font><font color="white"></font>

355
00:20:36,902 --> 00:20:39,112
<font color="white"><i>Sorakkan</i></font><font color="white"></font>

356
00:20:39,196 --> 00:20:41,740
<font color="white"><i>Sorakkan</i></font><font color="white"></font>

357
00:20:41,823 --> 00:20:43,992
<font color="white">Aku tak mendengar kemiripannya. Kalian?</font><font color="white"></font>

358
00:20:46,787 --> 00:20:48,914
<font color="white">Yang pertama adalah lagu kita, bukan?</font><font color="white"></font>

359
00:20:50,749 --> 00:20:51,959
<font color="white">Bukan, yang kedua.</font><font color="white"></font>

360
00:20:52,042 --> 00:20:53,168
<font color="white">Atau yang pertama, ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

361
00:20:54,086 --> 00:20:55,629
<font color="white">Keduanya terdengar identik.</font><font color="white"></font>

362
00:20:55,712 --> 00:21:00,425
<font color="white"><i>Agensi Triangle, Yonggu Records,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>belum mengeluarkan pernyataan resmi…</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

363
00:21:03,553 --> 00:21:05,347
<font color="white">Sungguh hari yang indah.</font><font color="white"></font>

364
00:21:06,348 --> 00:21:10,352
<font color="white">Hari pertamaku bertemu denganmu,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">langitnya seindah ini.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

365
00:21:10,852 --> 00:21:14,690
<font color="white">Ada keindahan dalam cara seseorang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang pergi saat sudah saatnya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

366
00:21:15,190 --> 00:21:17,484
<font color="white">Kau tak boleh pergi!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Bereskan kekacauan ini!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

367
00:21:17,567 --> 00:21:18,652
<font color="white"><i>Adios.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

368
00:21:19,361 --> 00:21:20,487
<font color="white">Halo?</font><font color="white"></font>

369
00:21:23,573 --> 00:21:25,575
<font color="white">Jangan salah paham, ya. Dengarkan aku.</font><font color="white"></font>

370
00:21:26,493 --> 00:21:28,120
<font color="white">Ini bukan cuma karena kejadian itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

371
00:21:28,203 --> 00:21:32,040
<font color="white">Aku mulai merasa terkekang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sebagai anggota grup,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

