00:21:32,124 --> 00:21:33,292
<font color="white">dan dapat penawaran bagus.</font><font color="white"></font>

373
00:21:35,127 --> 00:21:38,171
<font color="white">Dari siapa, Do-mi? Tuan Hong?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Apa kau memberitahunya tentang aku?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

374
00:21:38,255 --> 00:21:39,715
<font color="white">Tidak.</font><font color="white"></font>

375
00:21:39,798 --> 00:21:40,924
<font color="white">Aku heran lihat kalian!</font><font color="white"></font>

376
00:21:45,178 --> 00:21:46,596
<font color="white">Siapa itu?</font><font color="white"></font>

377
00:21:49,766 --> 00:21:51,351
<font color="white">Satu komentar saja, tolong!</font><font color="white"></font>

378
00:21:51,435 --> 00:21:52,853
<font color="white">Apa kau memang menyontek lagu itu?</font><font color="white"></font>

379
00:21:52,936 --> 00:21:54,396
<font color="white">- Hyun-woo!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Satu komentar!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

380
00:21:54,479 --> 00:21:57,024
<font color="white">- Kau akan mengeluarkan pernyataan?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Satu komentar!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

381
00:21:57,107 --> 00:21:58,817
<font color="white">- Benarkah itu?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Kenapa kau…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

382
00:21:58,900 --> 00:22:00,652
<font color="white">Bersembunyi tak akan menyelesaikan ini!</font><font color="white"></font>

383
00:22:00,736 --> 00:22:02,571
<font color="white">Hyun-woo! Satu komentar saja!</font><font color="white"></font>

384
00:22:07,159 --> 00:22:08,618
<font color="white">Apa yang sedang terjadi?</font><font color="white"></font>

385
00:22:10,662 --> 00:22:12,873
<font color="white">Ya, ini pasti mimpi buruk.</font><font color="white"></font>

386
00:22:13,457 --> 00:22:16,376
<font color="white">Jika berkedip satu kali,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">aku akan terbangun.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

387
00:22:19,338 --> 00:22:21,923
<font color="white">MASA KINI</font><font color="white"></font>

388
00:22:46,615 --> 00:22:50,744
<font color="white"><i>"Aku tak mau mempermalukan diriku</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>di hadapan pacarku."</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

389
00:22:51,244 --> 00:22:53,663
<font color="white"><i>"Tapi suatu hari, krisis terjadi."</i></font><font color="white"></font>

390
00:22:53,747 --> 00:22:56,917
<font color="white">"Itu pada pertemuan pertama</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dengan orang tuanya."</font><font color="white"></font></font>

391
00:22:57,793 --> 00:22:58,835
<font color="white">"Tebak, apa yang terjadi?"</font><font color="white"></font>

392
00:22:58,919 --> 00:23:02,422
<font color="white">"Aku berakhir duduk di pangkuan ayahnya!"</font><font color="white"></font>

393
00:23:04,925 --> 00:23:07,344
<font color="white">MENURUTNYA ITU LUCU</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">AKU TAK TAHAN DENGAN TAWANYA</font><font color="white"></font></font>

394
00:23:07,427 --> 00:23:08,929
<font color="white">SIAPA PRIA INI? TAK DIKENAL?</font><font color="white"></font>

395
00:23:09,012 --> 00:23:14,601
<font color="white">RADIO SBC</font><font color="white"></font>

396
00:23:15,894 --> 00:23:16,895
<font color="white">Hyun-woo.</font><font color="white"></font>

397
00:23:21,108 --> 00:23:24,069
<font color="white">Dahulu, aku penggemar berat Triangle.</font><font color="white"></font>

398
00:23:28,448 --> 00:23:29,825
<font color="white">Ya, bisa kulihat.</font><font color="white"></font>

399
00:23:30,742 --> 00:23:34,329
<font color="white">Sangat keren bahwa kalian berempat</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">begitu selaras dalam tiap gerakan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

400
00:23:37,624 --> 00:23:38,500
<font color="white">Kami cuma bertiga.</font><font color="white"></font>

401
00:23:40,502 --> 00:23:41,586
<font color="white">Ya, bertiga. Benar.</font><font color="white"></font>

402
00:23:43,338 --> 00:23:45,507
<font color="white">Kalian adalah trio pria terbaik saat itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

403
00:23:46,633 --> 00:23:47,467
<font color="white">Trio campuran.</font><font color="white"></font>

404
00:23:52,931 --> 00:23:53,765
<font color="white">Bajingan.</font><font color="white"></font>

405
00:23:53,849 --> 00:23:54,975
<font color="white">Apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

406
00:23:55,058 --> 00:23:55,892
<font color="white">"Tamu," kataku.</font><font color="white"></font>

407
00:23:55,976 --> 00:23:58,395
<font color="white">Aku adalah anggota permanen,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sedangkan kau ba…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

408
00:23:59,813 --> 00:24:01,064
<font color="white">Maksudku, tamu.</font><font color="white"></font>

409
00:24:07,779 --> 00:24:08,697
<font color="white">"Tamu."</font><font color="white"></font>

410
00:24:10,323 --> 00:24:11,825
<font color="white">Makasih atas segalanya.</font><font color="white"></font>

411
00:24:14,077 --> 00:24:15,287
<font color="white">Apakah jadwalnya ditukar?</font><font color="white"></font>

412
00:24:16,913 --> 00:24:19,916
<font color="white">- Apakah programnya dibatalkan?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tentu saja tidak.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

413
00:24:20,000 --> 00:24:21,835
<font color="white">Tak akan, dengan peringkat setinggi ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

414
00:24:21,918 --> 00:24:24,629
<font color="white">Jadi, hanya aku yang diberhentikan?</font><font color="white"></font>

415
00:24:26,423 --> 00:24:28,717
<font color="white">Salahkan kebodohanku dalam bekerja.</font><font color="white"></font>

416
00:24:28,800 --> 00:24:29,885
<font color="white">Tuan Oh.</font><font color="white"></font>

417
00:24:30,802 --> 00:24:33,346
<font color="white">Ini satu-satunya program</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang kukerjakan sekarang.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

418
00:24:33,430 --> 00:24:34,848
<font color="white">Satu lagi di TV kabel, bukan?</font><font color="white"></font>

419
00:24:34,931 --> 00:24:37,434
<font color="white">Aku sudah diberhentikan enam bulan silam.</font><font color="white"></font>

420
00:24:39,144 --> 00:24:42,189
<font color="white">Aku kurang akrab denganmu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">untuk tahu tentang itu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

421
00:24:43,481 --> 00:24:46,193
<font color="white">Kita bisa mengakrabkan diri</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">mulai sekarang.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

422
00:24:46,276 --> 00:24:47,444
<font color="white">Kita sebaya.</font><font color="white"></font>

423
00:24:48,862 --> 00:24:49,821
<font color="white">Aku setahun lebih tua.</font><font color="white"></font>

424
00:24:49,905 --> 00:24:51,072
<font color="white">Kak, apa alasannya?</font><font color="white"></font>

425
00:24:52,574 --> 00:24:54,409
<font color="white">Apa kesalahanku, Kak?</font><font color="white"></font>

426
