<font color="white">Tentu.</font><font color="white"></font>

857
00:51:17,908 --> 00:51:19,743
<font color="white">- Nikmatilah.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Bagus, terima kasih.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

858
00:51:20,994 --> 00:51:23,079
<font color="white">Baik, Nyonya.</font><font color="white"></font>

859
00:51:23,914 --> 00:51:27,042
<font color="white">Aku tak yakin makanan murahan ini</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">akan sesuai dengan seleramu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

860
00:51:27,125 --> 00:51:29,878
<font color="white">Tak apa-apa.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Aku belum sungguh menjadi kaya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

861
00:51:31,379 --> 00:51:33,840
<font color="white">Aku cuma hidup bersama orang kaya, tahu?</font><font color="white"></font>

862
00:51:33,924 --> 00:51:35,634
<font color="white">Cuma hidup bersama orang kaya, ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

863
00:51:36,593 --> 00:51:40,847
<font color="white">Itu memang membuatku iri,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tapi sebenarnya juga agak menyedihkan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

864
00:51:41,348 --> 00:51:44,226
<font color="white">Kau anggap itu menyedihkan?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Lucu sekali terucap olehmu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

865
00:51:44,893 --> 00:51:48,688
<font color="white">Kau buang harga dirimu hanya demi mencoba</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">muncul lagi melalui sebuah konser.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

866
00:51:48,772 --> 00:51:51,650
<font color="white">Hei, harga diri tak memberiku makanan.</font><font color="white"></font>

867
00:51:52,150 --> 00:51:55,028
<font color="white">Lagi pula, andai kalian</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tak meninggalkanku saat itu,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

868
00:51:55,111 --> 00:51:57,405
<font color="white">aku pasti masih punya harga diri.</font><font color="white"></font>

869
00:51:58,323 --> 00:52:00,325
<font color="white">Meninggalkan? Meninggalkanmu?</font><font color="white"></font>

870
00:52:01,660 --> 00:52:02,661
<font color="white">Kami meninggalkanmu?</font><font color="white"></font>

871
00:52:02,744 --> 00:52:06,414
<font color="white">Kau dan Sang-gu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">langsung teken kontrak dengan agensi lain.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

872
00:52:06,498 --> 00:52:07,707
<font color="white">Sungguh, kau…</font><font color="white"></font>

873
00:52:11,044 --> 00:52:12,546
<font color="white">Ingatanmu sangat bagus.</font><font color="white"></font>

874
00:52:12,629 --> 00:52:15,340
<font color="white">Mengesankan.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Bagaimana kau bisa ingat semuanya?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

875
00:52:15,423 --> 00:52:17,008
<font color="white">Kenapa kau mengingat semuanya?</font><font color="white"></font>

876
00:52:32,691 --> 00:52:35,861
<font color="white">- Menurutmu Do-mi akan tetap bersama kita?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Kuragukan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

877
00:52:35,944 --> 00:52:38,780
<font color="white">Tapi kuduga dia bisa berubah pikiran</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">setelah tampil di panggung.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

878
00:52:38,864 --> 00:52:39,698
<font color="white">Teman, Do-mi itu…</font><font color="white"></font>

879
00:52:40,323 --> 00:52:41,241
<font color="white">Tunggu sebentar.</font><font color="white"></font>

880
00:52:42,450 --> 00:52:46,037
<font color="white">Aku merasa tahu pria itu,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tapi dari mana, ya?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

881
00:52:47,038 --> 00:52:48,290
<font color="white">Hei, memang tampak familier.</font><font color="white"></font>

882
00:52:49,499 --> 00:52:50,500
<font color="white">Sungguh?</font><font color="white"></font>

883
00:52:50,584 --> 00:52:52,460
<font color="white">Mungkin dia bekerja di bisnis hiburan?</font><font color="white"></font>

884
00:52:52,544 --> 00:52:53,378
<font color="white">Mungkin saja.</font><font color="white"></font>

885
00:52:57,048 --> 00:52:57,883
<font color="white">Teman-Teman.</font><font color="white"></font>

886
00:52:57,966 --> 00:52:59,968
<font color="white">Itu Park Yong-gu.</font><font color="white"></font>

887
00:53:06,182 --> 00:53:08,852
<font color="white">- Tunggu.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Kau!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

888
00:53:13,064 --> 00:53:14,149
<font color="white">Park Yong-gu!</font><font color="white"></font>

889
00:53:19,946 --> 00:53:22,157
<font color="white">Baik, dengarkan baik-baik.</font><font color="white"></font>

890
00:53:22,240 --> 00:53:24,200
<font color="white">Pria ini bukan Park Yong-gu.</font><font color="white"></font>

891
00:53:24,284 --> 00:53:26,161
<font color="white">Dia adalah Tuan Emiliano Scaloni.</font><font color="white"></font>

892
00:53:26,244 --> 00:53:28,747
<font color="white">Kewarganegaraannya bukan Korea,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tapi Argentina.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

893
00:53:28,830 --> 00:53:30,916
<font color="white">Ini paspornya. Lihatlah.</font><font color="white"></font>

894
00:53:32,125 --> 00:53:33,168
<font color="white">Tak mungkin.</font><font color="white"></font>

895
00:53:34,044 --> 00:53:35,670
<font color="white">Kau pasti Park Yong-gu. Mengakulah!</font><font color="white"></font>

896
00:53:37,047 --> 00:53:39,925
<font color="white">Aku bukan orang Korea, tapi Argentina!</font><font color="white"></font>

897
00:53:40,008 --> 00:53:41,843
<font color="white">Kau adalah Park Yong-gu!</font><font color="white"></font>

898
00:53:41,927 --> 00:53:45,013
<font color="white">Kau Park Yong-gu dari Yonggu Records</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang menggondol uang kami!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

899
00:53:45,096 --> 00:53:46,765
<font color="white">Memangnya aku berwajah Korea?</font><font color="white"></font>

900
00:53:46,848 --> 00:53:51,311
<font color="white">Kau kira aku tak akan mengenalimu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">jika kau berbahasa asing dan berkumis?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

901
00:53:51,394 --> 00:53:53,772
<font color="white">- Aduh, pasti perih.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Jangan begini memperlakukan orang asing!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

902
00:53:53,855 --> 00:53:55,357
<font color="white">Menurutmu apa yang kau lakukan?</font><font color="white"></font>

903
00:53:55,941 --> 00:53:58,109
<font color="white">Jangan lakukan ini padaku!</font><font color="white"></font>

904
00:53:58,693 --> 00:53:59,986
<font color="white">Tapi kumisnya tampak asli.</font><font color="white"></font>

905
00:54:00,820 --> 00:54:03,990
<font color="white">Dengarkan aku.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Apa kau ingin melapor kepada polisi?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

906
00:54:04,074 --> 00:54:04,908
<font color="white">Lalu menggugat?</font><font color="white"></font>

907
00:54:05,659 --> 00:54:07,077
<font color="white">Tidak mau polisi.</font><font color="white"></font>

908
00:54:07,160 --> 00:54:09,663
<font color="white">Aku sibuk. Ada urusan, sangat penting.</font><font color="white"></font>

909
00:54:09,746 --> 00:54:12,749
<font color="white">Aku tak punya waktu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">untuk pergi ke kantor polisi!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

910
00:54:12,832 --> 00:54:14,292
<font color="white">Baiklah!</font><font color="white"></font>

911
00:54:14,376 --> 00:54:16,586
<font color="white">Selamat datang di Korea, Tuan Scaloni.</font><font color="white"></font>

912
00:54:16,670 --> 00:54:18,421
<font color="white">- Dah.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Terima kasih.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

913
00:54:19,339 --> 00:54:20,340
<font color="white">Hei, kekacauan yang…</font><font color="white"></font>

914
00:54:20,423 --> 00:54:22,300
<font color="white">- Hei!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tenanglah.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

915
00:54:28,890 --> 00:54:31,351
<font color="white">BMW 9841 BIRU TUA</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">MERCEDES-BENZ 8340</font><font color="white"></font></font>

916
00:54:34,312 --> 00:54:35,313
<font color="white"><i>Itu memang dia.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

917
00:54:35,397 --> 00:54:37,148
<font color="white">Bedebah itu adalah Tuan Park.</font><font color="white"></font>

918
00:54:37,983 --> 00:54:40,568
<font color="white">Andai memang Tuan Park,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">kita bisa berbuat apa sekarang?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

919
00:54:40,652 --> 00:54:43,196
<font color="white">Kita harus membalas dendam.</font><font color="white"></font>

920
00:54:43,279 --> 00:54:44,948
<font color="white">Aku menjadi begini gara-gara siapa?</font><font color="white"></font>

921
00:54:46,658 --> 00:54:49,869
<font color="white">Hei, kurasa aku melihat mobilnya.</font><font color="white"></font>

922
00:54:53,790 --> 00:54:54,791
<font color="white">Sial.</font><font color="white"></font>

923
00:54:55,834 --> 00:54:56,876
<font color="white">Kawan, kau sedang apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

924
00:54:57,919 --> 00:54:59,004
<font color="white"><i>Kita harus menangkapnya!</i></font><font color="white"></font>

925
00:54:59,087 --> 00:55:01,756
<font color="white"><i>- Apa? Tidak, jangan.</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>- Tancap gas. Nanti dia hilang.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

926
00:55:01,840 --> 00:55:03,299
<font color="white"><i>Aku ingin uangku. Tancap gas.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

927
00:55:03,383 --> 00:55:05,051
<font color="white"><i>- Jangan. Kau gila?</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>- Mengebutlah.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

928
00:55:05,135 --> 00:55:07,971
<font color="white">- Ada apa denganmu, Do-mi?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Lekas, tancap gas.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

929
00:55:08,054 --> 00:55:10,432
<font color="white">- Tidak, jangan.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Cepat. Susullah.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

930
00:55:10,515 --> 00:55:12,225
<font color="white">- Tancap gas!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tamatlah riwayatmu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

931
00:55:19,024 --> 00:55:20,442
<font color="white">Kita mendapatkannya.</font><font color="white"></font>

932
00:55:20,525 --> 00:55:22,235
<font color="white"><i>- Lebih cepat!</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>- Tidak, stop!</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

933
00:55:22,318 --> 00:55:23,778
<font color="white">Melambatlah, stop!</font><font color="white"></font>

934
00:55:24,738 --> 00:55:26,156
<font color="white">Sungguh, stop!</font><font color="white"></font>

935
00:55:32,871 --> 00:55:33,830
<font color="white">Kena, kau.</font><font color="white"></font>

936
00:55:34,456 --> 00:55:36,416
<font color="white">- Kita mendapatkannya di sini.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Nanti kau menabraknya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

937
00:55:36,499 --> 00:55:38,793
<font color="white">- Tidak, terlalu dekat. Nanti menabrak.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Hei!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

938
00:55:38,877 --> 00:55:41,337
<font color="white">Bagaimana jika kita menabraknya?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Kita harus tampil! Sadarlah!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

939
00:55:41,421 --> 00:55:42,464
<font color="white">Aku mengenalmu!</font><font color="white"></font>

940
00:55:42,547 --> 00:55:44,090
<font color="white">Hei, Park Yong-gu!</font><font color="white"></font>

941
00:55:44,174 --> 00:55:45,925
<font color="white"><i>Aku ingin uangku! Bayar utangmu!</i></font><font color="white"></font>

942
00:55:46,009 --> 00:55:47,552
<font color="white">- Celaka.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tabraklah saja!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

943
00:55:47,635 --> 00:55:49,220
<font color="white">- Kau sudah gila?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Ayo!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

944
00:55:49,304 --> 00:55:50,680
<font color="white">- Kau gila? Diam!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tabraklah.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

945
00:55:50,764 --> 00:55:52,098
<font color="white">Perlukah kutabrak saja?</font><font color="white"></font>

946
00:55:52,182 --> 00:55:54,184
<font color="white">- Tabraklah. Lakukan.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tidak, jangan!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

947
00:55:54,267 --> 00:55:56,186
<font color="white">- Lakukan.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Kulakukan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

948
00:55:56,269 --> 00:55:57,145
<font color="white">Jangan kehilangan kewarasan!</font><font color="white"></font>

949
00:55:57,228 --> 00:55:58,438
<font color="white">- Tidak!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tabrak saja!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

950
00:55:58,521 --> 00:55:59,564
<font color="white">- Sekarang!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tidak!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

951
00:56:14,704 --> 00:56:16,456
<font color="white">Sudah kukatakan jangan kau lakukan.</font><font color="white"></font>

952
00:56:17,415 --> 00:56:19,834
<font color="white">Hyun-woo, kurasa kau sungguh kena masalah.</font><font color="white"></font>

953
00:56:20,502 --> 00:56:21,544
<font color="white">Bagaimana ini?</font><font color="white"></font>

954
00:56:27,300 --> 00:56:28,426
<font color="white">Bagaimana ini?</font><font color="white"></font>

955
00:56:28,510 --> 00:56:30,428
<font color="white">- Tidak.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Bagaimana ini?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

956
00:56:30,512 --> 00:56:32,180
<font color="white">Tidak!</font><font color="white"></font>

957
00:56:32,263 --> 00:56:33,181
<font color="white">Hei!</font><font color="white"></font>

958
00:56:34,432 --> 00:56:36,351
<font color="white">- Tunggu!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Hei, tunggu!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

959
00:56:48,863 --> 00:56:50,406
<font color="white">Hei, Park Yong-gu?</font><font color="white"></font>

960
00:56:53,493 --> 00:56:55,036
<font color="white">Dia masih hidup. Bernapas.</font><font color="white"></font>

961
00:56:55,537 --> 00:56:56,371
<font color="white">- Dia hidup.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Benarkah?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

962
00:56:56,454 --> 00:56:58,665
<font color="white">- Haruskah kita panggil ambulans?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tentu saja!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

963
00:56:59,582 --> 00:57:00,500
<font color="white">Kenapa kau menanyaiku?</font><font color="white"></font>

964
00:57:00,583 --> 00:57:02,502
<font color="white">Kau sangat emosional</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan nyaris membunuhnya tadi.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

965
00:57:02,585 --> 00:57:05,964
<font color="white">Jadi, kau yang akan ditangkap, bukan aku.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Karena itulah kutanyai.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

966
00:57:06,548 --> 00:57:08,049
<font color="white">- Aku akan ditangkap?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Ya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

967
00:57:09,092 --> 00:57:10,510
<font color="white">Do-mi, kau memanas-manasiku!</font><font color="white"></font>

968
00:57:10,593 --> 00:57:12,387
<font color="white">- Benar.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Wah! Tunggu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

969
00:57:12,470 --> 00:57:14,681
<font color="white">- Kurasa dia baru memandangku.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Apa?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

970
00:57:18,393 --> 00:57:19,310
<font color="white">Apa-apaan?</font><font color="white"></font>

971
00:57:19,394 --> 00:57:20,937
<font color="white">Kau yakin tak salah lihat?</font><font color="white"></font>

972
00:57:21,020 --> 00:57:22,439
<font color="white">- Kutampar saja, ya?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Jangan!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

973
00:57:22,522 --> 00:57:24,774
<font color="white">Bagaimana jika dia sungguh terluka?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Nanti makin parah.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

974
00:57:25,358 --> 00:57:26,484
<font color="white">Kita masukkan ke mobil saja.</font><font color="white"></font>

975
00:57:26,568 --> 00:57:28,069
<font color="white">Kita antar ke rumah sakit atau…</font><font color="white"></font>

976
00:57:28,153 --> 00:57:30,238
<font color="white">- Atau kuburkan di hutan.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Ya, di hutan…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

977
00:57:30,321 --> 00:57:32,157
<font color="white">Hei! Itu tak terlintas di benakku.</font><font color="white"></font>

978
00:57:35,368 --> 00:57:36,536
<font color="white">- Astaga.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Berat sekali!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

979
00:57:40,248 --> 00:57:42,500
<font color="white">- Gawat!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Jangan lepaskan cengkeramanmu!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

980
00:57:43,084 --> 00:57:45,211
<font color="white">- Tidak!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Kucengkeram erat-erat!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

981
00:57:48,256 --> 00:57:49,466
<font color="white">- Bagaimana ini?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Sial.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

982
00:57:50,008 --> 00:57:51,885
<font color="white">- Astaga, bagaimana ini?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Angkat dia!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

983
00:57:56,639 --> 00:57:59,851
<font color="white">- Sial, lagi!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Kenapa kau terus melepaskannya?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

984
00:58:02,979 --> 00:58:04,063
<font color="white">Aku tak mau melakukan ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

985
00:58:11,154 --> 00:58:12,572
<font color="white">- Ya ampun.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Apa aku keliru?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

986
00:58:13,448 --> 00:58:14,699
<font color="white">Dia belum melek sama sekali.</font><font color="white"></font>

987
00:58:16,868 --> 00:58:19,454
<font color="white">Bagaimana jika dia malah mati</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">gara-gara kau terus melepaskannya?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

988
00:58:19,537 --> 00:58:21,539
<font color="white">Aku memeganginya erat-erat.</font><font color="white"></font>

989
00:58:29,547 --> 00:58:31,508
<font color="white">Maafkan aku! Aku sopir pemula.</font><font color="white"></font>

990
00:58:31,591 --> 00:58:32,800
<font color="white">Pemula?</font><font color="white"></font>

991
00:58:32,884 --> 00:58:34,677
<font color="white">Tapi mengemudikan truk jungkit?</font><font color="white"></font>

992
00:58:35,470 --> 00:58:38,306
