1421
01:24:27,562 --> 01:24:29,522
<font color="white">Lagunya sudah mulai. Sana, lekas.</font><font color="white"></font>

1422
01:24:30,231 --> 01:24:32,108
<font color="white">- Wah, ini laguku. Laguku!</font><font color="white">
