1449
01:26:24,429 --> 01:26:26,181
<font color="white"><i>Aku menyukaimu</i></font><font color="white"></font>

1450
01:26:26,264 --> 01:26:28,725
<font color="white"><i>Aku menyukaimu setengah mati</i></font><font color="white"></font>

1451
01:26:28,808 --> 01:26:31,769
<font color="white"><i>Aku menyukaimu</i></font><font color="white"></font>

1452
01:26:32,437 --> 01:26:33,396
<font color="white">Hyun-woo.</font><font color="white"></font>

1453
01:26:34,022 --> 01:26:37,192
<font color="white">Menurutku,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Triangle tak bisa tampil hari ini.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1454
01:26:38,860 --> 01:26:40,987
<font color="white">Apa maksudmu? Tidak benar begitu, bukan?</font><font color="white"></font>

1455
01:26:41,821 --> 01:26:44,157
<font color="white">Kami hanya mengikuti instruksi produser.</font><font color="white"></font>

1456
01:26:44,240 --> 01:26:46,034
<font color="white">Pergilah dahulu. Aku akan menyusul.</font><font color="white"></font>

1457
01:26:46,117 --> 01:26:47,118
<font color="white">- Lekas.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Ya, tentu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1458
01:26:47,202 --> 01:26:48,244
<font color="white">Tidak, tunggu.</font><font color="white"></font>

1459
01:26:54,834 --> 01:26:56,794
<font color="white">Bagaimana isyarat jarimu? Begini?</font><font color="white"></font>

1460
01:26:56,878 --> 01:26:58,880
<font color="white">Kira-kira seperti ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

1461
01:26:58,963 --> 01:27:00,131
<font color="white">Ya, segitiga. Triangle.</font><font color="white"></font>

1462
01:27:00,715 --> 01:27:04,719
<font color="white">Tak ada yang mengingat Triangle.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Kau merasa bisa tampil sebagai penutup?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

