01:27:04,802 --> 01:27:05,845
<font color="white">Tae-poong.</font><font color="white"></font>

1464
01:27:06,930 --> 01:27:08,598
<font color="white">Ini kesempatan terakhir kami.</font><font color="white"></font>

1465
01:27:08,681 --> 01:27:11,267
<font color="white">Kami harus tampil di panggung ini.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Jadi, kumohon…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1466
01:27:11,976 --> 01:27:14,979
<font color="white">Biarkan kami tampil di sini hari ini.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Kumohon, Tae-poong.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1467
01:27:15,063 --> 01:27:17,857
<font color="white">Wah, kau akhirnya menyebut</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">namaku dengan benar.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1468
01:27:17,941 --> 01:27:19,484
<font color="white">Itu nama yang keren.</font><font color="white"></font>

1469
01:27:19,567 --> 01:27:20,568
<font color="white">Yang benar saja.</font><font color="white"></font>

1470
01:27:20,652 --> 01:27:24,572
<font color="white">Dahulu, kalian memperlakukanku</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">seolah-olah aku tak terlihat.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1471
01:27:24,656 --> 01:27:27,992
<font color="white">Saat kita jumpa tempo hari,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">kau nyaris tak mengenaliku, bukan?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1472
01:27:28,076 --> 01:27:30,328
<font color="white">Tapi aku langsung mengenalimu.</font><font color="white"></font>

1473
01:27:30,411 --> 01:27:35,541
<font color="white">Saat ini, aku jauh lebih terkenal</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">daripada kau. Kenapa kau tak mengenaliku?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1474
01:27:35,625 --> 01:27:37,460
<font color="white">Kau salah paham. Sebenarnya…</font><font color="white"></font>

1475
01:27:38,378 --> 01:27:41,839
<font color="white">Kami selalu iri terhadap rupa dan bakatmu.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Jadi, kami mengabaikanmu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1476
01:27:41,923 --> 01:27:43,174
<font color="white">Omong kosong!</font><font color="white"></font>

1477
01:27:43,258 --> 01:27:46,970
<font color="white">Kau memujiku karena sangat ingin tampil.</font><font color="white"></font>

1478
01:27:47,053 --> 01:27:49,305
<font color="white">Triangle adalah penggemar Megaton.</font><font color="white"></font>

1479
01:27:49,389 --> 01:27:50,473
<font color="white">Berhentilah memujiku.</font><font color="white"></font>

1480
01:27:50,556 --> 01:27:51,724
<font color="white">Sungguh!</font><font color="white"></font>

1481
01:27:58,064 --> 01:28:02,443
<font color="white"><i>Aku menggandengmu</i></font><font color="white"></font>

1482
01:28:04,362 --> 01:28:07,323
<font color="white"><i>Aku menyukaimu</i></font><font color="white"></font>

1483
01:28:07,991 --> 01:28:09,701
<font color="white"><i>Aku menyukaimu</i></font><font color="white"></font>

1484
01:28:09,784 --> 01:28:13,079
