1502
01:29:06,215 --> 01:29:08,384
<font color="white">Aku akhirnya bisa tampil lagi,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tapi malah mengacau.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1503
01:29:11,387 --> 01:29:15,099
<font color="white">Aku adalah penyanyi balada</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang memikat penonton dengan suaraku.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1504
01:29:15,683 --> 01:29:16,809
<font color="white">Hei, Tae-poong.</font><font color="white"></font>

1505
01:29:17,602 --> 01:29:18,770
<font color="white">Tae-poong, kumohon!</font><font color="white"></font>

1506
01:29:21,064 --> 01:29:22,190
<font color="white">Tae-poong, kali ini saja.</font><font color="white"></font>

1507
01:29:22,732 --> 01:29:24,442
<font color="white">Maksudnya Tae-poong, bukan taifun?</font><font color="white"></font>

1508
01:29:24,525 --> 01:29:26,319
<font color="white">Dengarkan, kami tadi melalui…</font><font color="white"></font>

1509
01:29:27,653 --> 01:29:32,116
<font color="white">bencana besar hanya demi tiba di sini</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tepat waktu untuk tampil.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1510
01:29:40,249 --> 01:29:41,292
<font color="white">Mari kita lakukan.</font><font color="white"></font>

1511
01:29:42,960 --> 01:29:43,920
<font color="white">Apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

1512
01:29:46,964 --> 01:29:48,716
<font color="white">Aku hanya ingin tampil.</font><font color="white"></font>

1513
01:29:50,968 --> 01:29:52,637
<font color="white">Kenapa harus sesulit itu?</font><font color="white"></font>

1514
01:29:54,222 --> 01:29:55,348
<font color="white">Tidak, jangan!</font><font color="white"></font>

1515
01:29:58,518 --> 01:29:59,769
<font color="white">- Tangkap mereka.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Hei!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1516
01:29:59,852 --> 01:30:01,437
<font color="white">Tetaplah bersama kami, nikmati konsernya.</font><font color="white"></font>

1517
01:30:01,521 --> 01:30:05,108
<font color="white">Yang berikutnya adalah satu penampil lagi.</font><font color="white"></font>

1518
01:30:05,191 --> 01:30:06,984
<font color="white">Biar saya perkenalkan.</font><font color="white"></font>

1519
01:30:07,735 --> 01:30:09,779
<font color="white">Inilah penampil terakhir malam ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

1520
01:30:11,239 --> 01:30:13,825
<font color="white">Dia terlalu terkenal sekarang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">jika hanya disebut penyanyi retro.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1521
01:30:13,908 --> 01:30:15,076
<font color="white">Inilah anggota Megaton…</font><font color="white"></font>

1522
01:30:18,287 --> 01:30:19,455
<font color="white">Saya…</font><font color="white"></font>

1523
01:30:19,539 --> 01:30:21,165
<font color="white">- Saya pasti…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Halo, Penonton!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1524
01:30:21,749 --> 01:30:24,043
<font color="white">Saya Byeon Do-mi,</font><font color="white"></font>

1525
01:30:24,919 --> 01:30:26,379
<font color="white">dan tampil kembali!</font><font color="white"></font>

1526
01:30:26,462 --> 01:30:29,090
<font color="white"><i>Baca dari depan, namaku Gu Sang-gu</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Baca dari belakang, tetap Gu Sang-gu</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

1527
01:30:29,173 --> 01:30:31,134
<font color="white">Halo! Saya adalah ketua Triangle,</font><font color="white"></font>

1528
01:30:31,217 --> 01:30:33,261
<font color="white">Dance Machine. DM. Hwang Hyun-woo.</font><font color="white"></font>

1529
01:30:33,344 --> 01:30:36,514
<font color="white">Kalian sudah siap</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">untuk bergembira bersama Triangle?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1530
01:30:36,597 --> 01:30:38,891
<font color="white">Apa mereka sudah benar-benar gila?</font><font color="white"></font>

1531
01:30:39,475 --> 01:30:41,936
<font color="white">Apa? Tidak dengar!</font><font color="white"></font>

1532
01:30:43,354 --> 01:30:45,982
<font color="white">Baik! Mari kita bergembira!</font><font color="white"></font>

1533
01:30:46,065 --> 01:30:47,775
<font color="white">Semuanya, lambaikan tangan di atas!</font><font color="white"></font>

