01:31:55,551 --> 01:31:58,971
<font color="white"><i>- Tersenyumlah padaku</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>- Tersenyumlah padaku</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

1550
01:31:59,055 --> 01:32:04,769
